      "side": 1,
      "message": "1) Just making sure you don\u0027t mind another entry into the state machine\n\n2) It can be easier to reason about if the events are serialized on a Handler instead of having locks or atomics everywhere. I don\u0027t see anything obviously wrong here; I\u0027m just suggesting it would be more maintainable.",
